WEBVTT

00:00:18.930 --> 00:00:21.540
All right, I'm up!

00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:40.310
youki ni kuchibue fuite

00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:40.310
Whistling a cheerful tune

00:00:40.310 --> 00:00:42.640
madobe no kotori to sesshon

00:00:40.310 --> 00:00:42.640
I join the birds chirping by the window

00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:45.560
suima ga yatte kite

00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:45.560
When fatigue strikes

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:48.190
atama ga danshingu

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:48.190
My imagination runs wild

00:00:48.190 --> 00:00:50.650
nan demo kan demo waraeru nichijou

00:00:48.190 --> 00:00:50.650
Everything in life makes me smile

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:53.490
okimari na kishoutenketsu

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:53.490
Nothing really new takes place

00:00:53.490 --> 00:00:56.120
demo demo tama ni wa piritto supaisu

00:00:53.490 --> 00:00:56.120
But sometimes it's exciting to spice things up

00:00:56.120 --> 00:00:58.740
aozora peintingu

00:00:56.120 --> 00:00:58.740
Let's paint it on the blue sky

00:00:58.740 --> 00:00:59.790
doko ikou

00:00:58.740 --> 00:00:59.790
Where should we go?

00:00:59.790 --> 00:01:01.370
koko ni iyou

00:00:59.790 --> 00:01:01.370
Let's stay here

00:01:01.370 --> 00:01:02.370
sore wa nani

00:01:01.370 --> 00:01:02.370
What's that?

00:01:02.370 --> 00:01:03.960
are yaritai

00:01:02.370 --> 00:01:03.960
I wanna try that!

00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:06.540
ima ni tokubetsu na shirushi

00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:06.540
Let's make this moment count

00:01:06.540 --> 00:01:11.920
tokeibari no mawashikata watashi shidai kamo

00:01:06.540 --> 00:01:11.920
How fast my clock moves is all up to me

00:01:13.170 --> 00:01:15.590
shiki oriori iro toridori

00:01:13.170 --> 00:01:15.590
With a rich palette of colors from the four seasons

00:01:15.590 --> 00:01:18.050
nonbiri na everyday

00:01:15.590 --> 00:01:18.050
Our laid-back everyday lives can be

00:01:18.050 --> 00:01:20.680
pasuteru bibiddo metoro

00:01:18.050 --> 00:01:20.680
Any blend of pastel, vivid, and metro colors

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:23.520
jibun dake no karaaringu

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:23.520
Anyone can create their own coloring

00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:26.100
sono tokidoki mune doki doki

00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:26.100
So when your heart races in excitement

00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:29.820
hachamecha na taiyou ni oegaki

00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:29.820
Just draw a sun at the top

00:01:29.820 --> 00:01:33.950
tobidasu aatishizumu

00:01:29.820 --> 00:01:33.950
And let your inner artist take you from there

00:01:33.950 --> 00:01:37.280
gyutto shite ii kana

00:01:33.950 --> 00:01:37.280
Can I hold your hand tight?

00:01:42.030 --> 00:01:44.660
suki suki suki wo sukecchi

00:01:42.030 --> 00:01:44.660
I've been sketching everything I love

00:01:44.660 --> 00:01:47.200
nijiiro ni somete iku yo

00:01:44.660 --> 00:01:47.200
And painting them in rainbow colors

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:51.960
sore ja ittekimasu

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:51.960
All right, I'm off to have some more fun!

00:01:57.470 --> 00:01:58.590
Swimsuit, check.

00:01:58.590 --> 00:01:59.850
Sweatshirt, check.

00:01:59.850 --> 00:02:01.610
Writing utensils, check.

00:02:01.610 --> 00:02:03.520
Program, check.

00:02:04.400 --> 00:02:07.830
I don't want to forget anything today.

00:02:08.920 --> 00:02:10.150
That's everything, right?

00:02:11.220 --> 00:02:12.940
Ready to go!

00:02:14.690 --> 00:02:16.950
Maybe I woke up a bit <i>too</i> early.

00:02:18.950 --> 00:02:21.580
Miya-chan, morning!

00:02:23.830 --> 00:02:25.890
Morning, Yunocchi.

00:02:25.890 --> 00:02:27.410
You're up early today.

00:02:27.410 --> 00:02:27.960
Yeah!

00:02:28.380 --> 00:02:33.840
I thought I'd go to school early today since we have the swimming competition.

00:02:34.280 --> 00:02:36.340
Okay. Yunocchi, hold on.

00:02:36.680 --> 00:02:37.840
I'll go with you.

00:02:37.840 --> 00:02:39.310
Just give me ten seconds.

00:02:42.740 --> 00:02:44.850
There's no need to rush.

00:02:44.850 --> 00:02:45.850
Five,

00:02:45.850 --> 00:02:46.850
four,

00:02:46.850 --> 00:02:47.850
three,

00:02:47.850 --> 00:02:48.850
two,

00:02:48.850 --> 00:02:49.850
one.

00:02:49.850 --> 00:02:51.750
Thanks for waiting!

00:02:51.750 --> 00:02:52.860
Let's go.

00:02:52.860 --> 00:02:54.940
Exactly ten seconds!

00:02:58.450 --> 00:02:59.200
Oh!

00:02:59.200 --> 00:03:01.130
Good morning, Nakayama-san!

00:03:01.130 --> 00:03:02.950
Morning!

00:03:02.950 --> 00:03:05.350
Good morning, Yuno-san, Miya-chan.

00:03:05.350 --> 00:03:06.870
Today's going to be fun.

00:03:06.870 --> 00:03:10.170
Yeah, today's our first swimming competition!

00:03:10.170 --> 00:03:12.790
I was so excited that I ended up getting here early.

00:03:12.790 --> 00:03:14.570
Did you have breakfast, Yuno-san?

00:03:14.570 --> 00:03:16.210
Yeah, I did!

00:03:16.210 --> 00:03:17.230
Did you cook it yourself?

00:03:17.230 --> 00:03:19.530
Yeah, I made bacon, eggs, and salad.

00:03:19.530 --> 00:03:22.230
And some toast and tea, too.

00:03:22.230 --> 00:03:24.510
Wow! That's a full breakfast.

00:03:24.510 --> 00:03:27.510
Well, usually I just have toast and tea.

00:03:27.510 --> 00:03:30.730
I woke up early today, so I had extra time.

00:03:30.730 --> 00:03:32.970
I see. How about you, Miya-chan?

00:03:32.970 --> 00:03:35.430
A big bowl of rice with furikake!

00:03:35.430 --> 00:03:37.070
What a simple meal.

00:03:37.070 --> 00:03:40.370
Yeah, so I can carb up quickly.

00:03:40.370 --> 00:03:42.550
Oh, you've thought pretty far ahead.

00:03:42.550 --> 00:03:45.510
But I'll probably get hungry again while we wait.

00:03:47.910 --> 00:03:50.620
Good morning, everyone.

00:03:51.020 --> 00:03:55.330
The weather is great today.

00:03:55.330 --> 00:03:57.350
It's a perfect day for swimming.

00:03:57.350 --> 00:03:58.840
I appreciate all your help today.

00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:01.680
Oh, of course. I'm looking forward to it.

00:04:01.680 --> 00:04:05.910
Kuwahara-sensei, I doubt anything bad will happen,

00:04:05.910 --> 00:04:09.970
but please be on standby for any emergencies as usual.

00:04:09.970 --> 00:04:11.480
Yep! You can count on me.

00:04:11.480 --> 00:04:14.690
So, where's Yoshinoya-sensei?

00:04:17.340 --> 00:04:18.570
I'm so sorry I'm late!

00:04:18.570 --> 00:04:21.280
It took me forever to settle on a swimsuit!

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:25.370
You were <i>almost</i> late, but not quite.

00:04:25.370 --> 00:04:26.170
Yes.

00:04:26.170 --> 00:04:30.910
I'm fine with you choosing a pretty swimsuit, but make sure it's nothing too eccentric.

00:04:30.910 --> 00:04:35.050
Teachers have to be role models for the students.

00:04:35.050 --> 00:04:36.170
Remember, there's a time and place for every—

00:04:36.170 --> 00:04:37.920
Yes, I'm aware.

00:04:37.920 --> 00:04:42.370
So, for today I chose a swimsuit that perfectly suits a teacher!

00:04:42.370 --> 00:04:44.050
Are you sure?

00:04:44.050 --> 00:04:45.050
Absolutely!

00:04:45.520 --> 00:04:46.800
Very well.

00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:51.810
Then let's make this an enjoyable swimming competition with no injuries or accidents.

00:04:52.180 --> 00:04:53.010
Yes!

00:04:54.310 --> 00:04:57.310
One, two, three, four...

00:04:57.310 --> 00:04:59.850
Let's go get 'em!

00:04:59.850 --> 00:05:00.940
Yeah!

00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:02.790
Oh? Yuno-san!

00:05:02.790 --> 00:05:05.190
Ah, Nori-chan, good morning!

00:05:05.190 --> 00:05:07.130
You're a record-keeper?

00:05:07.130 --> 00:05:07.700
Yeah!

00:05:08.120 --> 00:05:12.630
I can float now, but I still can't swim.

00:05:12.630 --> 00:05:15.830
I would've participated in the pebble picking contest,

00:05:16.710 --> 00:05:19.210
but now I can't go underwater.

00:05:19.210 --> 00:05:22.090
So you can't participate in any events now?

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:26.590
That's it for the basic instructions.

00:05:26.590 --> 00:05:30.680
You two will be taking turns shooting photos, right?

00:05:30.680 --> 00:05:32.180
Yes.

00:05:32.180 --> 00:05:34.250
Here you go. It's a digital camera.

00:05:34.250 --> 00:05:35.470
This is the power button,

00:05:35.470 --> 00:05:37.450
and this is the mode dial.

00:05:37.450 --> 00:05:40.190
Well, the auto mode should be fine for the most part.

00:05:40.190 --> 00:05:42.030
Got it! We'll do our best!

00:05:42.030 --> 00:05:46.180
It can hold a lot of photos, so shoot away!

00:05:46.180 --> 00:05:49.990
Once you've taken a picture of each event, feel free to take other random pictures.

00:05:49.990 --> 00:05:53.450
Also, come ask me if there's
anything you can't figure out.

00:05:53.450 --> 00:05:54.210
Okay!

00:05:54.210 --> 00:05:58.010
And this isn't waterproof, so try not to drop it in the pool.

00:05:58.010 --> 00:05:59.000
O-Okay.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:02.690
This probably costs around 100,000 yen, just so you know.

00:06:02.690 --> 00:06:04.010
I don't want to do this anymore.

00:06:04.010 --> 00:06:08.850
Miyako-san, how was the swimming competition last year?

00:06:08.850 --> 00:06:10.050
We didn't have one.

00:06:10.050 --> 00:06:10.760
Huh?

00:06:11.100 --> 00:06:13.770
Last year, it was only among students in the regular program.

00:06:13.770 --> 00:06:15.890
And this year, it's the arts students only.

00:06:16.280 --> 00:06:18.630
Oh, so this is arts students only.

00:06:18.630 --> 00:06:20.770
I thought it'd be a joint event.

00:06:20.770 --> 00:06:23.610
Then, it's Class A versus Class B, right?

00:06:23.610 --> 00:06:26.070
Which events are you swimming in, Miyako-san?

00:06:26.070 --> 00:06:30.200
The medley relay and the second-year girls' 50-meter freestyle.

00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:34.230
You can show off how freely you swim in it.

00:06:34.230 --> 00:06:36.540
Just go with the fastest stroke, please.

00:06:39.260 --> 00:06:41.500
There's a crowd forming now.

00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:44.460
Yeah! The spectator spots are really filling up.

00:06:44.820 --> 00:06:49.030
Zoom in and out like this and set the auto-focus...

00:06:49.030 --> 00:06:51.470
Where are the settings? Oh, this.

00:06:51.470 --> 00:06:52.990
Let me see.

00:06:52.990 --> 00:06:54.850
It has a shake compensation feature too!

00:06:55.350 --> 00:06:57.750
I wonder how much shaking it can handle.

00:06:58.540 --> 00:06:59.910
Say cheese!

00:06:59.910 --> 00:07:00.520
Whoa!

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:02.830
100... 100... 100,000 yen!

00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:04.330
Right.

00:07:05.360 --> 00:07:08.400
This is your first swimming
competition, right, Nazuna-chan?

00:07:08.400 --> 00:07:09.530
Yes.

00:07:09.530 --> 00:07:12.170
You saw one two years ago, right?

00:07:12.170 --> 00:07:14.160
No, just a year ago.

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:18.130
It was among the regular students last year, but I came to watch.

00:07:18.130 --> 00:07:19.710
I live close by anyway.

00:07:19.710 --> 00:07:22.920
Oh, like how I am now.

00:07:22.920 --> 00:07:27.380
Art students don't have to attend if they aren't in any event.

00:07:27.720 --> 00:07:29.880
They're pretty laid back about that.

00:07:30.200 --> 00:07:32.910
It's like a university cultural festival.

00:07:32.910 --> 00:07:34.430
Maybe.

00:07:34.430 --> 00:07:35.430
Oops!

00:07:35.780 --> 00:07:39.430
Participation isn't mandatory,
which I'd say is Yamabuki-like.

00:07:39.430 --> 00:07:43.940
Then again, most students come anyway, which is also Yamabuki-like.

00:07:44.940 --> 00:07:47.190
Hello, everyone.

00:07:47.190 --> 00:07:49.970
Today is the swimming competition.

00:07:49.970 --> 00:07:58.250
Swimmers and spectators, take care to avoid injuries and accidents, and make sure to have a lot of fun!

00:07:56.660 --> 00:07:58.640
Everyone!

00:07:58.640 --> 00:08:00.830
Good morning!

00:08:00.830 --> 00:08:05.090
I wanted to feel like one of the swimmers,

00:08:05.090 --> 00:08:08.710
so I dressed up in a school swimsuit today!

00:08:08.710 --> 00:08:09.840
Oh.

00:08:09.840 --> 00:08:13.970
It's borderline inappropriate.

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:15.470
Well, I'll allow it this time.

00:08:15.820 --> 00:08:21.730
Now, let the swimming competition between arts classes A and B begin!

00:08:22.240 --> 00:08:25.030
Everyone, are you ready to go?

00:08:25.030 --> 00:08:26.190
Yep!

00:08:26.190 --> 00:08:29.030
Today's the last day the pool will be open this year.

00:08:29.540 --> 00:08:33.410
I look forward to seeing beautiful swimming!

00:08:33.720 --> 00:08:35.240
All right...

00:08:35.240 --> 00:08:38.290
Here's a demonstration!

00:08:38.290 --> 00:08:39.240
Jump!

00:08:41.830 --> 00:08:43.830
That must've hurt.

00:08:45.830 --> 00:08:50.210
The next event is the first-year girls' 50-meter freestyle.

00:08:50.210 --> 00:08:51.840
Ready...

00:08:51.840 --> 00:08:53.090
Set...

00:08:56.050 --> 00:08:58.430
<i>Good luck, Nori-chan!</i>

00:09:13.040 --> 00:09:15.450
First place, lane four!

00:09:15.840 --> 00:09:17.280
All right!

00:09:17.570 --> 00:09:18.580
Nori-chan!

00:09:18.580 --> 00:09:19.730
That was amazing.

00:09:19.730 --> 00:09:20.730
You were so fast!

00:09:20.730 --> 00:09:22.250
Looking good.

00:09:22.250 --> 00:09:23.830
Oh, Yuno-san!

00:09:23.830 --> 00:09:24.790
Yay!

00:09:24.790 --> 00:09:27.910
Nori-chan, nice smile.

00:09:27.910 --> 00:09:30.190
Nice. Very nice.

00:09:30.190 --> 00:09:33.170
What's that? You sound like a supermodel photographer.

00:09:33.780 --> 00:09:36.310
Okay, now take off something!

00:09:36.310 --> 00:09:38.470
Then I'd be naked!

00:09:40.720 --> 00:09:44.130
Nori-chan, congratulations! You did great!

00:09:44.130 --> 00:09:46.910
Nazuna, you came to watch me?

00:09:46.910 --> 00:09:47.600
Yeah!

00:09:47.600 --> 00:09:49.470
You should've just stayed home.

00:09:49.470 --> 00:09:51.910
It would've been a nice day off for you.

00:09:52.640 --> 00:09:53.530
But...

00:09:53.880 --> 00:09:57.280
I wanted to see you shine in the competition!

00:09:57.280 --> 00:09:58.910
What's that supposed to mean?

00:09:58.910 --> 00:09:59.660
That's embarrassing!

00:10:03.320 --> 00:10:04.690
Sorry.

00:10:06.920 --> 00:10:09.190
Did you take a photo of that?

00:10:09.920 --> 00:10:12.290
Jeez, delete that!

00:10:12.290 --> 00:10:13.770
Nori-chan, time out.

00:10:13.770 --> 00:10:15.130
This is 100,000 yen!

00:10:19.600 --> 00:10:24.030
The next event is the boys' 100-meter freestyle.

00:10:22.720 --> 00:10:26.490
Yuno-san, we have to take photos of boys too, right?

00:10:26.490 --> 00:10:28.600
Huh? Yeah, I think so.

00:10:29.060 --> 00:10:30.440
<i>Boys in swimsuits feel like different creatures.</i>

00:10:30.440 --> 00:10:32.470
<i>Boys in swimsuits feel like different creatures.</i>

00:10:32.470 --> 00:10:34.510
<i>It's hard to look at them directly.</i>

00:10:34.510 --> 00:10:36.450
<i>So much skin is exposed.</i>

00:10:38.160 --> 00:10:40.810
<i>Oh my! I shouldn't be thinking that.</i>

00:10:40.810 --> 00:10:42.850
<i>I'm a record-keeper.</i>

00:10:42.850 --> 00:10:44.910
<i>They're just the subjects of my photos!</i>

00:10:44.910 --> 00:10:46.910
<i>I-I have to take photos.</i>

00:10:46.910 --> 00:10:50.780
<i>But... But... I can't look at them directly!</i>

00:10:50.780 --> 00:10:51.920
Nakayama-san?

00:10:53.920 --> 00:10:56.350
That concludes the morning events.

00:10:56.350 --> 00:10:58.840
The afternoon events will begin at 1:30.

00:11:00.590 --> 00:11:03.180
Wow, gorgeous!

00:11:03.180 --> 00:11:05.060
It looks so good!

00:11:05.060 --> 00:11:07.250
Can I take a photo of this?

00:11:07.250 --> 00:11:11.750
Sure, but are you allowed to?

00:11:11.750 --> 00:11:15.530
I think it'd capture a moment of the swimming competition.

00:11:15.530 --> 00:11:17.570
Yeah, it might be a good idea.

00:11:19.070 --> 00:11:20.490
Thank you so much!

00:11:20.490 --> 00:11:22.510
I got a nice photo.

00:11:22.510 --> 00:11:25.590
Can we get those photos later?

00:11:26.780 --> 00:11:29.250
It must be a lot of work being a record-keeper!

00:11:29.250 --> 00:11:31.070
Well then, dig in!

00:11:31.070 --> 00:11:33.250
Let's eat!

00:11:33.250 --> 00:11:33.750
Japanese!

00:11:33.750 --> 00:11:34.250
Western!

00:11:34.250 --> 00:11:35.750
Both.

00:11:35.750 --> 00:11:38.650
Let me try the omelet.

00:11:39.200 --> 00:11:40.970
It's delicious!

00:11:40.970 --> 00:11:44.260
I love lukewarm fried chicken out of a lunch box!

00:11:44.260 --> 00:11:46.810
I love everything!

00:11:46.810 --> 00:11:47.770
We know.

00:11:50.770 --> 00:11:52.520
Yeah, looks good!

00:11:52.880 --> 00:11:56.130
I wanna take photos of other people having lunch too.

00:11:56.130 --> 00:11:59.190
Let's see. I think this is the zoom.

00:11:59.190 --> 00:12:01.030
Yes, that's the one.

00:12:01.030 --> 00:12:02.610
Thanks, Nori-chan.

00:12:03.340 --> 00:12:06.790
They're still too far away.

00:12:06.790 --> 00:12:10.080
You'd need a telephoto lens to take picture that far away.

00:12:10.630 --> 00:12:12.630
Maybe I'll go around later to take photos.

00:12:12.630 --> 00:12:15.130
You seem to have a lot of work, Yuno-san.

00:12:15.130 --> 00:12:17.630
Nori-chan, would you like another cup of tea?

00:12:17.630 --> 00:12:19.090
Oh, thank you.

00:12:20.590 --> 00:12:23.590
Nori-chan, congratulations on first place!

00:12:23.590 --> 00:12:25.430
You were fast!

00:12:25.430 --> 00:12:27.070
Congratulations!

00:12:27.070 --> 00:12:28.970
Oh, thank you.

00:12:29.180 --> 00:12:31.730
All that practice was worth it.

00:12:32.060 --> 00:12:37.900
Everyone, your principal will be giving a demonstration now.

00:12:37.900 --> 00:12:43.240
Please enjoy the show while you eat lunch.

00:12:43.600 --> 00:12:45.740
The principal can swim?!

00:12:54.080 --> 00:12:55.320
Amazing!

00:12:55.320 --> 00:12:57.060
He's fast!

00:12:57.060 --> 00:13:00.670
He should participate in the swimming competition too.

00:13:01.840 --> 00:13:03.680
He doesn't have anyone to compete against.

00:13:15.440 --> 00:13:19.270
Yeah, no one would be a match for him.

00:13:19.270 --> 00:13:20.750
Yeah!

00:13:20.750 --> 00:13:23.650
Kids shouldn't imitate him anyway.

00:13:26.030 --> 00:13:29.010
That concludes my performance.

00:13:29.010 --> 00:13:31.170
Thank you for your time.

00:13:36.250 --> 00:13:38.500
Sae, do your best!

00:13:38.500 --> 00:13:39.840
Thanks.

00:13:42.500 --> 00:13:44.430
Huh? Natsume?

00:13:44.430 --> 00:13:45.790
S-Sae!

00:13:45.790 --> 00:13:47.790
What, you're not swimming?

00:13:47.790 --> 00:13:49.330
That's no fun.

00:13:49.330 --> 00:13:51.470
W-Well, excuse me!

00:13:51.470 --> 00:13:53.510
I'm not good at swimming.

00:13:53.510 --> 00:13:54.530
Is that so?

00:13:55.080 --> 00:13:57.190
Do you want me to teach you later?

00:13:57.440 --> 00:14:00.670
Don't make vague promises like that!

00:14:00.670 --> 00:14:02.250
You're always like that!

00:14:02.250 --> 00:14:04.440
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:14:06.380 --> 00:14:10.620
Third-year swimmers, please take your positions.

00:14:10.620 --> 00:14:12.290
I should go.

00:14:12.290 --> 00:14:13.550
See you later.

00:14:21.200 --> 00:14:22.470
Can I sit next to you?

00:14:22.470 --> 00:14:25.430
Oh, yeah, go ahead.

00:14:25.430 --> 00:14:26.510
Thanks!

00:14:27.260 --> 00:14:29.570
I can get a good view from here!

00:14:29.570 --> 00:14:31.870
Sae's up next, isn't she?

00:14:31.870 --> 00:14:32.720
Yeah.

00:14:32.720 --> 00:14:37.270
The next event is the third-year girls' 50-meter fly.

00:14:38.390 --> 00:14:40.900
Sae-san's so cool.

00:14:39.440 --> 00:14:40.900
Ready...

00:14:40.900 --> 00:14:42.400
Set...

00:14:45.280 --> 00:14:47.150
That was a neat dive!

00:14:47.150 --> 00:14:49.400
She's already ahead of the rest!

00:14:49.400 --> 00:14:50.410
Yeah!

00:14:51.340 --> 00:14:52.690
<i>Don't lose!</i>

00:14:52.690 --> 00:14:54.580
<i>Keep it up, Sae!</i>

00:15:01.460 --> 00:15:04.460
Yay! A Kodak moment!

00:15:03.440 --> 00:15:05.670
First place, lane six!

00:15:05.670 --> 00:15:07.770
Wow! Amazing!

00:15:07.770 --> 00:15:10.210
<i>Oops, we were getting along.</i>

00:15:10.210 --> 00:15:13.300
<i>Huh? Natsume-san is in Class B. Why is she happy?</i>

00:15:15.310 --> 00:15:20.810
The last event today is a medley relay among the selected teams from each class!

00:15:22.100 --> 00:15:24.060
All right, I'm off!

00:15:24.060 --> 00:15:25.690
Okay, good luck!

00:15:25.690 --> 00:15:27.550
I'll be cheering for you!

00:15:27.550 --> 00:15:29.570
Go with the fastest stroke.

00:15:29.570 --> 00:15:31.820
Yeah, leave it to me!

00:15:32.180 --> 00:15:33.390
Ready...

00:15:32.500 --> 00:15:35.470
Miya-chan is on freestyle, so she's swimming the anchor leg, right?

00:15:34.280 --> 00:15:35.470
Set...

00:15:35.470 --> 00:15:36.210
Yeah.

00:15:37.660 --> 00:15:41.420
The medley relay is now in its final stage!

00:15:41.420 --> 00:15:43.670
Currently, Class B is slightly ahead!

00:15:45.670 --> 00:15:46.920
Miya-chan, good luck!

00:15:51.550 --> 00:15:53.870
Wow, Miya-chan is fast!

00:15:53.870 --> 00:15:56.550
She outswam the other swimmer so quickly.

00:15:57.840 --> 00:15:58.560
Huh?

00:16:00.060 --> 00:16:03.560
She's doing a breath-holding crawl!

00:16:04.500 --> 00:16:09.480
S-Shouldn't Miyako-senpai take a breath?!

00:16:13.500 --> 00:16:15.160
<i>Miya-chan, do your best!</i>

00:16:16.910 --> 00:16:18.410
<i>Ten meters left.</i>

00:16:16.910 --> 00:16:18.410
Go for it!

00:16:18.410 --> 00:16:19.660
<i>Five meters left.</i>

00:16:21.760 --> 00:16:24.290
Miyako, keep going!

00:16:21.940 --> 00:16:24.290
Yuno-san, you don't need to hold <i>your</i> breath.

00:16:33.960 --> 00:16:36.170
Miya-chan, that was awesome!

00:16:37.300 --> 00:16:39.790
Miyako-san, you won first place!

00:16:39.790 --> 00:16:41.140
Congratulations!

00:16:41.460 --> 00:16:43.470
Thanks, guys!

00:16:43.470 --> 00:16:46.150
I figured this would be the fastest.

00:16:46.560 --> 00:16:49.150
Here are the results of the medley relay.

00:16:49.150 --> 00:16:51.010
First place, 2-A.

00:16:51.010 --> 00:16:52.550
Second place, 1-A.

00:16:52.550 --> 00:16:54.030
Third place, 3-B.

00:16:54.030 --> 00:16:55.810
Fourth place, 2-B.

00:16:55.810 --> 00:16:57.370
Fifth place, 3-A.

00:16:57.370 --> 00:16:59.280
Sixth place, 1-B.

00:17:02.380 --> 00:17:05.290
Good work, everyone.

00:17:05.290 --> 00:17:08.610
I'm happy that the event concluded without incident.

00:17:08.610 --> 00:17:10.690
Indeed. It's a relief.

00:17:10.690 --> 00:17:14.750
Good job with the demonstration, Mr. Principal.

00:17:14.750 --> 00:17:16.930
The students seemed to have loved it.

00:17:16.930 --> 00:17:19.890
Oh, it was just a small performance.

00:17:19.890 --> 00:17:22.890
Ah, testing, testing!

00:17:25.690 --> 00:17:30.310
Okay, all events for the day have ended!

00:17:30.310 --> 00:17:32.820
On to the announcement of the results!

00:17:32.820 --> 00:17:37.430
In today's swimming competition between arts program classes A versus B,

00:17:37.430 --> 00:17:39.170
the winner is...

00:17:39.170 --> 00:17:43.080
Drum roll, please...

00:17:43.720 --> 00:17:44.580
Tada!

00:17:45.380 --> 00:17:47.410
Class A!

00:17:50.920 --> 00:17:57.350
Class B will be cleaning the pool next week for losing!

00:17:57.350 --> 00:17:58.930
Really?

00:17:58.930 --> 00:18:01.330
Good work, everyone!

00:18:01.330 --> 00:18:05.250
Make sure you don't forget your belongings as you leave.

00:18:06.940 --> 00:18:08.710
It's all done now!

00:18:08.710 --> 00:18:10.370
It's great that we won.

00:18:10.370 --> 00:18:12.870
Yeah! Sae-san, you did great!

00:18:12.870 --> 00:18:16.530
So the losing class has to clean the pool?

00:18:16.530 --> 00:18:18.150
Yeah, sorry.

00:18:18.150 --> 00:18:20.530
We couldn't tell you about it because of a gag order.

00:18:23.870 --> 00:18:26.030
Canned coker?

00:18:26.030 --> 00:18:27.960
That didn't get across too well.

00:18:28.380 --> 00:18:33.630
The third-years had a swimming competition two
years ago, so we knew what the the losers have to do,

00:18:33.630 --> 00:18:37.690
but you don't want to swim hard just to avoid cleaning the pool, right?

00:18:37.690 --> 00:18:39.760
Oh, that makes sense!

00:18:51.420 --> 00:18:54.050
Yuno-san, let's go return the camera.

00:18:54.050 --> 00:18:56.730
Yeah, just one more shot.

00:18:59.500 --> 00:19:04.030
The last photo is the empty pool, eh?

00:19:04.420 --> 00:19:07.910
Yep! You took a lot of great photos.

00:19:08.540 --> 00:19:12.210
It was the right choice to get 2D art students to do it!

00:19:12.210 --> 00:19:14.210
Good job!

00:19:14.210 --> 00:19:19.670
We'll be posting your photos on the school events section of the Yamabuki High home page.

00:19:20.000 --> 00:19:21.670
Thank you much!

00:19:21.670 --> 00:19:26.070
Okay, Mashiko-sensei. Please get that done by today.

00:19:26.070 --> 00:19:28.060
What? Why me?!

00:19:28.060 --> 00:19:32.710
Because you saw me in school swimsuit today!

00:19:32.710 --> 00:19:35.030
I never asked you to show me.

00:19:35.030 --> 00:19:37.190
What did you say?!

00:19:37.190 --> 00:19:38.710
You're a terrible man!

00:19:38.710 --> 00:19:40.530
Excuse us.

00:19:44.980 --> 00:19:51.310
And so, Mashiko-sensei should've updated the Yamabuki High home page.

00:19:51.310 --> 00:19:52.830
That's cool.

00:19:52.830 --> 00:19:54.870
Yamabuki High...

00:19:54.870 --> 00:19:56.230
School events...

00:19:56.230 --> 00:19:58.590
Swimming competition, huh?

00:19:58.590 --> 00:20:01.370
Oh, there's the update!

00:20:01.370 --> 00:20:02.470
You're right!

00:20:02.470 --> 00:20:03.590
Let me see that.

00:20:03.590 --> 00:20:06.270
Oh, I took this picture!

00:20:06.270 --> 00:20:07.910
That's a neat photo!

00:20:07.910 --> 00:20:10.250
None of the students' faces are shown, huh?

00:20:10.250 --> 00:20:12.230
Yoshinoya-sensei is on there.

00:20:12.700 --> 00:20:15.230
Can I click to enlarge the picture?

00:20:18.620 --> 00:20:22.660
They didn't shrink this photo at all?

00:20:22.660 --> 00:20:24.240
Amazing...

00:20:24.240 --> 00:20:25.370
Boobs...

00:20:25.780 --> 00:20:28.530
That wasn't very well-thought out.

00:20:28.530 --> 00:20:34.850
I wonder if Mashiko-sensei has the sense that Yoshinoya-sensei is a woman?

00:20:34.850 --> 00:20:39.790
Well, I think the photo is just too large.

00:20:39.790 --> 00:20:42.800
Like, he probably messed up the resize.

00:20:42.800 --> 00:20:46.270
Still, I'll text Yoshinoya-sensei about it.

00:20:46.270 --> 00:20:49.680
I bet Mashiko-chan will have a rough time tomorrow.

00:20:57.080 --> 00:20:59.950
It was a busy day today.

00:21:00.600 --> 00:21:03.750
I wonder how many photos we took.

00:21:03.750 --> 00:21:06.070
Nakayama-san took some, too,

00:21:06.070 --> 00:21:07.570
so over 100 photos?

00:21:07.960 --> 00:21:10.330
Digital cameras are amazing!

00:21:10.330 --> 00:21:13.860
I got beautiful photos even though it was my first time.

00:21:13.860 --> 00:21:18.670
And the trimming and light effects allow for interesting pictures.

00:21:19.960 --> 00:21:22.190
I kind of feel like a real photographer.

00:21:22.190 --> 00:21:24.970
I wanna print the other photos sometime.

00:21:28.430 --> 00:21:32.290
Will Sae-san be happy if I give her that photo?

00:21:32.290 --> 00:21:35.370
The photo I took of everyone at lunch, too.

00:21:35.920 --> 00:21:38.150
Oh, yeah!

00:21:38.150 --> 00:21:42.650
It'd be nice to take photos of everyone and put them in an album.

00:21:42.650 --> 00:21:47.410
I could ask everyone to help and give me ideas.

00:21:47.410 --> 00:21:49.910
Don't you think that might be a good idea?

00:21:50.300 --> 00:21:54.660
A digital camera... Maybe I'll buy a small one for myself.

00:21:55.340 --> 00:21:58.310
I ended up not figuring out how to swim,

00:21:58.310 --> 00:22:01.770
but I had fun being a record-keeper.

00:22:01.770 --> 00:22:05.830
I took part in the competition in my own way!

00:22:10.920 --> 00:22:13.000
Do you know the scary story of Hidamari Apartments?

00:22:13.000 --> 00:22:14.440
Slipping from the stairs and falling!

00:22:14.440 --> 00:22:15.220
Miya-chan!

00:22:15.220 --> 00:22:16.880
I'm scared of going to the bathroom at night!

00:22:16.880 --> 00:22:19.120
Sae-san's screams freak me out.

00:22:19.120 --> 00:22:20.540
I'm afraid of sweet things.

00:22:20.540 --> 00:22:21.360
Then I'm taking your cake.

00:22:21.360 --> 00:22:22.540
What?! Don't!

00:22:22.540 --> 00:22:23.320
Which reminds me,

00:22:23.320 --> 00:22:25.320
doesn't the stain on the ceiling look like a man's face?

00:22:25.320 --> 00:22:26.380
Stop it!

00:22:26.380 --> 00:22:28.180
I won't be able to fall asleep!

00:22:28.740 --> 00:22:32.920
Next time: "September 17th-19th, Nazuna Meal."

00:22:32.920 --> 00:22:35.840
"September 28th, Hyper Midnight."

00:22:35.840 --> 00:22:39.120
We'll be waiting at Hidamari Apartments, so come visit us!
